    "title": "C++ — From Beginner to Professional",
    "description": "A visual-first C++ curriculum that preserves the supplied 239-lesson syllabus and progresses from beginner foundations through safe object/resource management, the Standard Library, algorithms, concurrency, professional tooling and applied specializations. All content is draft pending technical review.",
