    "learning_outcomes": [
      "Write, compile, run, test, debug and maintain C++ programs using explicit standard modes and compiler diagnostics.",
      "Apply types, expressions, control flow, functions, containers, algorithms, classes, templates and the Standard Library.",
      "Reason about object lifetime, ownership, resource management, exceptions and concurrency safety.",
      "Organize multi-file projects with build systems, tests, version control and reproducible tooling.",
      "Evaluate performance, portability, security and standard-library support using evidence and documented trade-offs.",
      "Build progressive console, data-processing, systems-oriented and capstone projects."
    ],
